    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/idKeWgctGCJ4g8n1rdR_vDPlTMkfs3FARsVhcO4AAx8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Equation of Altitude } \\mathrm{AP}: \\mathrm{x}=1 \\\\ & \\text { Equation of Altitude } \\mathrm{BP}: \\mathrm{y}-0=1(\\mathrm{x}+2) \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}=1 \\& \\\\ & \\mathrm{x}-\\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{P}(1,3) \\\\ & \\text { Area of } \\triangle \\mathrm{PBC}=\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 3=6\\end{aligned}$",
